{"descriptionModels":[{"description":"Prerequisites: You must have received a dragon blessing or enhacement from an Young or older Dragon (The dragon must also be a True Dragon, either Chromatic, Gem, Metallic or other) either by favor, the energy released upon it\u0027s death or bathing or drinking portions of it\u0027s blood.\n\nYou gain senses akin of those of a dragon, becoming able to perceive things not seen, and to locate lurking creatures with uncanny precision, as well as to react quickly in danger situations. You gain the following:\n\nBlindsight: You have blindsight up to a range of 30 feet. Within that range, you can effectively see anything that isn’t behind total cover, even if you\u0027re blinded or in darkness. Moreover, you can see invisi­ble creatures within that range, unless the creatures successfully hide from you.\n\nKeen Senses: You have advantage on Wisdom (Perception) checks.\n\nPredatory Awareness: You have advantage in Initiave checks and you can\u0027t be surprised. You also remain conscious of your surroundings even while you sleep. Aditionally, as a free action at the start of each of your turns, you can take the Search action.","level":1}],"id":"Customc48d2a06-09d1-4594-bd14-4d87382c1976","isFeature":false,"jsonType":"feat","level":1,"name":"Draconic Gift of Enhanced Senses [FTD] [SM]","notes":"","type":"Feat"}